29.3pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">부 구비</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:150%;margin-left:26.8pt;text-indent:-26.8pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; -&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">정보통신보조기기 구입 시 발생하는 자부담금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">개인부담금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">지자체 납부 후 이체확인증</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">온라인 뱅킹 캡처 화면 등 납부 증빙자료 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">부 구비</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:150%;margin-left:27.0pt;text-indent:-27.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; -&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">정보통신보조기기 보급결정 통지문</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; 